// RUN: not %gopp check --check-error-limit=0 %S/Inputs/mem-replace 2>&1 | FileCheck "--implicit-check-not=error[E" %S/Inputs/mem-replace/main.gopp
// P03.22 review (R13, R22): mem.Replace(p, v) is `old := *p; *p = v`, so its
// T has a Copy use (Checker::noteIntrinsicUses), decided at every
// instantiation like the use of any generic body: a direct call, the
// function as a value and through a generic wrapper. The expected errors are
// the CHECK lines of Inputs/mem-replace/main.gopp.
